{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":8996,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793367037157,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":1978,"episodeCount":44,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s2CvUQ61iHet4mvkU4D5LVgoRf5.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"402940","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"L'invasione della Terra","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Il popolo alieno dei baamesi, dopo aver percorso le galassie, giunge nell'orbita di Giove con una base orbitante, il Piccolo Baam, e senza mezzi termini pianifica l'attacco contro la Terra.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-04-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lDZS6COEquydAdnTcrUkTkkNC1O.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lDZS6COEquydAdnTcrUkTkkNC1O.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"402941","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Erika la ragazza del mistero","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kazuya, affascinato dalla Erika, se la prende a cuore e cerca di assisterla affinché possa recuperare la memoria e fra i due ragazzi sboccia presto l'amore.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-04-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aCUutXWcKbN7JMC4DSt5YgAN9WK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aCUutXWcKbN7JMC4DSt5YgAN9WK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"402942","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"L'ala vulnerabile del nemico","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"La battaglia col mostro di Baam, infuriata nei pressi dell'ospedale, ha fatto divampare un incendio nella struttura che viene presto evacuata.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-04-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1uFQQvLIz3LTHAjfdpnGarb8fJ4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1uFQQvLIz3LTHAjfdpnGarb8fJ4.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"402943","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Identità ritrovata","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Alla base Daimovic si cerca di analizzare la mente di Erika, per scoprire il passato della ragazza ma senza ottenere grossi risultati. Questo accanimento medico fa imbestialire Kazuya che vede nelle cure una vera e propria tortura per la ragazza, e si scontra con Kyoshiro che si dimostra assai diffidente nei confronti della misteriosa ospite.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-04-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eMDe4D1qAOC0HUkbWibbuFSFr55.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eMDe4D1qAOC0HUkbWibbuFSFr55.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"402944","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Complesso di colpa","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Erika è a pezzi e svela al team della base il suo passato. La ragazza, tempo fa, accompagnò il padre, il Generalissimo Lion, e il fratello il principe Richter, una spedizione diplomatica presso una base sulla luna per avviare un dialogo e un rapporto di pace con una delegazione terrestre.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-04-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yrc7L48pPACa8K29JCdQZ7xeMow.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yrc7L48pPACa8K29JCdQZ7xeMow.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"402945","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Il sacrificio di Erika","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"La sparizione di Erika crea scompiglio nella base: la fuga della ragazza viene considerata un'ammissione di colpa, soprattutto dal generale Miwa, ufficiale guerrafondaio dell'esercito terrestre che si dimostra subito avverso al pilota di Daimos.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-05-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/VEINVHkLidhBeoTJlw3sLQTTo9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/VEINVHkLidhBeoTJlw3sLQTTo9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"402946","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Battaglia planetare","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Erika torna fra la sua gente, scortata presso la base sottomarina segreta del popolo baamese, pronta a dare spiegazioni sul suo periodo di assenza.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-05-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ftlPwczA00EshshejCBD6USiRXO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ftlPwczA00EshshejCBD6USiRXO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"402947","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Proteggete la Terra!","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kazuya è ancora stravolto per l'assenza di Erika mentre la ragazza, alla base baamese, viene duramente interrogata dal fratello Rikiter, convinto del tradimento della sorella.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-05-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6tFQ9JMUebWTDkHnjrOTrq8oCD6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6tFQ9JMUebWTDkHnjrOTrq8oCD6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"402948","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Un amico prezioso","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rikiter decide di avvalersi di valente combattente, suo personale amico, per eliminare Kazuya, pilota di Daimos.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-05-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8QemMWXGiDe6yKj3b5jVujwgMI6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8QemMWXGiDe6yKj3b5jVujwgMI6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"402949","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Lotta per la giustizia","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Alla base di Daimovic, Kazuya deve affrontare l'ottusità di Kito, il comandante dei soldati, fermamente deciso ad eliminare la minaccia baamese e colmo di odio per il nemico, responsabile della morte della famiglia.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-06-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n8gwBezvQ10WaKUTlDwkm7ZBZjx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n8gwBezvQ10WaKUTlDwkm7ZBZjx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"402950","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Una vecchia fiamma","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Un'elegantissima ragazza si presenta a Daimovic: è Reiko, una ex allieva di Kyoshiro dai tempi in cui il ragazzo insegnava francese. La giovane, tempo fa, fraintese le intenzioni di Kyoshiro ed ora è fermamente intenzionata a sposarsi.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-06-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qr1TJ3V0RWgy6kdUlFfmmxurYLV.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qr1TJ3V0RWgy6kdUlFfmmxurYLV.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"402951","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Il robot incantatore","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Alla base Daimovic Kazuya assiste ad un pò di modifiche innovative sulla conformazione dei saloni e delle camere per allestire un'infermeria e molti oggetti e luoghi gli ricordano continuamente l'amata Erika.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-06-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lXHLwufw2q3d6p3pIANNne9qal1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lXHLwufw2q3d6p3pIANNne9qal1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"402952","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"L'esca involontaria","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Erika, alla base baamese, si strugge per la sua condizione e perché sente su di sé la responsabilità della morte del padre di Kazuya, assassinato in occasione delle prime trattative tra terrestri e alieni.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-06-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cbWNrx8vnp13diSYOcc91SNPlVT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cbWNrx8vnp13diSYOcc91SNPlVT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"402953","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Il terribile Mabose","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Alla base nemica, Erika viene punita per il suo tradimento, così come Cindy, la ragazza che ha collaborato per la fuga. Rikiter però non è a conoscenza del fatto e tutto in mano a Laiza che ricatta Erika, costringendola a combattere con un mostro guerriero contro Daimos.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-07-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iIupPZGnwruZHfjE83vrgd335gZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iIupPZGnwruZHfjE83vrgd335gZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"402954","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"L'astronave dispersa","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rikiter viene a conoscenza del tradimento delle tre donne che vengono punite e imprigionate. Kazuya si reca alle nazioni unite per rivedere un vecchio filmato risalente alle prime trattative tra suo padre e la delegazione baamese e con sua immensa tristezza scopre che Erika era veramente presente nel momento dell'assassinio del genitore.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-07-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cl02YkqXq2Ob20ZEazSV6O54mbk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cl02YkqXq2Ob20ZEazSV6O54mbk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"402955","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Trappola mortale","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"I baamesi hanno condannato le donne traditrici e Rikiter si strugge per il destino della sorella. Margarethe ottiene da Rikiter un ultimo desiderio: far indossare a Erika l'abito da sposa della madre-regina.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-07-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6DTfw1EljBRKWBjvIGETV9EbLyM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6DTfw1EljBRKWBjvIGETV9EbLyM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"402956","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Verso la salvezza","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Erica climbs the death penalty. The light of Erica's heart, hoping for peace with the earth, was about to go out. However, among the people watching over the execution, there was the face of the director of Warlin Hospital.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-07-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mmlXSIBSjLsZRCfQdsqQHiEshWK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mmlXSIBSjLsZRCfQdsqQHiEshWK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"402957","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Prigioniera dei terrestri","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Grazie al Dottor Wallin, Erika è riuscita a fuggire dalla fortezza sottomarina di Baam. Il dottore e la ragazza però vengono recuperati in mare dal comandante Miwa e a bordo del sottomarino terrestre si dirigono verso la base della Difesa Terrestre.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-07-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ryOHN3fXlVdFCOQUeTw4rQkENKm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ryOHN3fXlVdFCOQUeTw4rQkENKm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"402958","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Missione di pace","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Erica escapes from the destroyed defense base. However, Erica has been housed in a mysterious spaceship. What is this man who stubbornly rejected Richter's request to return Erica?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-08-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rwNqRfjeWNay9xDG3kAnnlfhm3g.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rwNqRfjeWNay9xDG3kAnnlfhm3g.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"402959","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"La base segreta","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"La navetta misteriosa che ha salvato Erika è pilotata da un aiutante del dottor Wallin che porta la principessa da Baranduk, un pacifico baamese che ha costituito una comunità di alieni che non intende combattere ma integrarsi con i tertrestri.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-08-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rDUWcGbjRFaI7Kpl9cfNZYKJ11R.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rDUWcGbjRFaI7Kpl9cfNZYKJ11R.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"402960","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"La sosia di Erika","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kazuya, ancora agitato per aver parlato con Erika la quale non ha voluto rivelargli la sua posizione, si sottopone ad allenamenti massacranti ma con scarsi risultati.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-08-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sFN2WiKHflBGg78LAfnAd7fEev7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sFN2WiKHflBGg78LAfnAd7fEev7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"402961","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Triste infanzia","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kyoshiro ha un brutto sogno e ricorda i tempi in cui viveva a Parigi con la madre malata, che a stento riusciva a sopravvivere. L'incubo arriva al culmine e il giovane si sveglia di soprassalto. A quel punto decide di affrontare il motivo della sua tensione: una lettera del nonno, persona che odia da tempo.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-08-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/PrUU4tq8hVd5MaY5iw8tjwnibo.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/PrUU4tq8hVd5MaY5iw8tjwnibo.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"402962","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"L'appuntamento","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Okane, la governante della base Daimovic, comincia a fare strani discorsi sulla famiglia e i ragazzi alla base comprendono che anche per la donna è arrivato il momento di trovare marito. Nanà propone di farla incontrare con il sergente Kito, il burbero militare al servizio di Miwa.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-09-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lcoSDcbgzxuipTCLGx84CzkaRbo.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lcoSDcbgzxuipTCLGx84CzkaRbo.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"402963","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"La macchina fotografica","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Cairo, who was forced into the bath, struggled to get revenge on Nana. Cairo was burning with a big invention to take a picture of Nana's nakedness. What is the big invention?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-09-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lcXJfqhB4GFiCEhNfHMOHgkzDf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lcXJfqhB4GFiCEhNfHMOHgkzDf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"402964","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Faccia a faccia","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Earth capture that does not progress slowly. Chief Gishi Balm died mercilessly during the production of the Combat Robo. Richter, who saw it, wasn't crushed and finally set sail for Dymovic himself!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-09-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bxRHa1UI56TajE5BbGiTGBbaw8u.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bxRHa1UI56TajE5BbGiTGBbaw8u.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"402965","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"L'arma segreta","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"What is the mysterious person, the mysterious spaceship that saved Richter's crisis !? And the attack of the new battle robot completed by the best scientific power of Balm star put Daimos to the brink of death.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-09-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/br0On9Bmjii6c0S4IKFrVkMRMLw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/br0On9Bmjii6c0S4IKFrVkMRMLw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/26"},{"id":"402966","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":27,"title":{"value":"Le ultra particelle","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"It's only a matter of time before Daimos is defeated by the Mecha Warrior completed by Isamu. However, it is almost impossible to power up the energy of Deimos several tens of times. Is the fate of Daimos so far ?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-09-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vfZTmEyZYDZkk9ndnnsUW2U8nNs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vfZTmEyZYDZkk9ndnnsUW2U8nNs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/27"},{"id":"402967","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":28,"title":{"value":"Il grande scienziato","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Daimos achieved a power-up with Isaron particles. But that energy was developed by the genius scientist Isamu. Isamu laughed and showed a countermeasure. What is that terrifying secret ?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-10-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lBoKfsTet5uvakC4yX4C53Stxt9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lBoKfsTet5uvakC4yX4C53Stxt9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/28"},{"id":"402968","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":29,"title":{"value":"Attacco a Daimovic","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Richter's wrath, mourning Isamu's death, manifested itself as a global assault command. A total attack was launched on Dymovic at the United Nations Headquarters. Secretary Miwa did not give up that he should use the hydrogen bomb at the expense of the inhabitants.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-10-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lz5OSCGuDXdEhS4Iy9MxZy34rv1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lz5OSCGuDXdEhS4Iy9MxZy34rv1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/29"},{"id":"402969","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":30,"title":{"value":"Lotta contro il tempo","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Dr. Izumi saved himself from the explosion of Dymovic. However, he was seriously injured and wandered the deadline. Who can save the doctor's life? What is the fate of Dymovic, which is severely destroyed and damaged ?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-10-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bF4fYNxWVGS0j9Xnzh6OS0bzaC.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bF4fYNxWVGS0j9Xnzh6OS0bzaC.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/30"},{"id":"402970","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":31,"title":{"value":"Addio, Baranduk!","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A disk that had escaped from the balm star to the earth. Knowing this, Secretary Miwa rushed the fleet to capture the disk. Unexpectedly, I found a liberated area where Erica and Barandook hide.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-10-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8iKeaACLRpBKRB7Zhr2N6vCkgfP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8iKeaACLRpBKRB7Zhr2N6vCkgfP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/31"},{"id":"402971","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":32,"title":{"value":"Fuga da Utopia","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"What Barandoke's death left for Erica and his friends was a journey into a long and harsh winter season. Erika, who was targeted by Richter and called her nemesis by Secretary Miwa, just rushed through the snowstorm.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-11-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1rqBQB12cTDHJCECN5WIhnfYDYx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1rqBQB12cTDHJCECN5WIhnfYDYx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/32"},{"id":"402972","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":33,"title":{"value":"Sabotaggio","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"At Dymovic, I thought of Erica, who was missing, and every day was heartbreaking. One day, an uncontrollable naughty priest came. Its name is George Kojima. Motota, who dreams of fighting in Deimos, boarded a triper and jumped out.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-11-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jUT7zTvRIVp9dwIG0eiJesZVCwk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jUT7zTvRIVp9dwIG0eiJesZVCwk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/33"},{"id":"402973","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"Tradimenti","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Barbus' younger brother, Himley, suddenly escapes from Balm. A surprising fact came from his mouth to the undersea castle. And it will make a big difference to Admiral Richter!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-11-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vxkn0DsjHjss1hj0NfrXXnlqGZP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vxkn0DsjHjss1hj0NfrXXnlqGZP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/34"},{"id":"402974","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":35,"title":{"value":"Una breve amicizia","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"An undersea castle that fell into the hands of Geroyer. Now, surely something is starting in the Balm Alien. Is it a rebellion? Is it a plot !? The enemy general Barbas was unexpectedly launched on the beach of Daimovic.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-11-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eZqXGdHZo0v5KSGhX1pUEKTVJxL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eZqXGdHZo0v5KSGhX1pUEKTVJxL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/35"},{"id":"402975","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":36,"title":{"value":"Un'alleanza impossibile","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Indeed, Richter was pushed into the sea by a mecha warrior. However, Richter's corpse has not been found anywhere. What if !? Geroyer begins a desperate search.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-12-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yRK7K02cuc3n0vEnpYiWrnsM1DO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yRK7K02cuc3n0vEnpYiWrnsM1DO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/36"},{"id":"402976","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"Un vile ricatto","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Erica hastened to build a spaceship to return to Balm to overthrow Orban. However, the spaceship exploded in an accident. The secret base has collapsed. Hunger, cold, and blizzards push Erica into hell.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-12-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xsjcUjubApd2QypRWL9JW6qknwc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xsjcUjubApd2QypRWL9JW6qknwc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/37"},{"id":"402977","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"Comandante supremo","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Erica became Orban's bride and left the earth. Waiting for the remaining Ichiya was the arrest, imprisonment, and torture by Secretary Miwa. Secretary Miwa robbed Daimos from Ichiya.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-12-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qQLGTGW4qhr8A7XqOGaa8bsdADq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qQLGTGW4qhr8A7XqOGaa8bsdADq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/38"},{"id":"402978","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"Kazuya in trappola","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"UN inquiry committee members asking why they wouldn't give Daimos to Miwa. Ichiya stubbornly shakes his head. A letter arrives from the enemy general, Geroyer, to Ichiya who was in a difficult situation!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-12-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e2gn1P0NZvweuNQIQrUWTFHvep3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e2gn1P0NZvweuNQIQrUWTFHvep3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/39"},{"id":"402979","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":40,"title":{"value":"Attacco alla base sottomarina","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Suddenly, an undersea castle was involved in the explosion of a submarine volcano. Only at this time, the rebels led by Miwa devoted all their power to attacking the undersea castle. The move of Secretary Miwa, who is impatient, puts Daimos in danger!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-12-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zZ0HIbhWKQk3eiEvV56YonDnZoA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zZ0HIbhWKQk3eiEvV56YonDnZoA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/40"},{"id":"402980","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":41,"title":{"value":"Alle soglie di Baam","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The key to unraveling all mysteries is Balm Star. Dymovic headed for the asteroid belt. But sudden news. It was a voice calling for help from Erica.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1979-01-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vkWb4Dqskxq19ts0aQrqfk30gh4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vkWb4Dqskxq19ts0aQrqfk30gh4.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8996/season/1/episode/41"},{"id":"402981","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":42,"title":{"value":"Attacco a Baam","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A spaceship invaded the small balm, confused by the endless meteor shower. It was Richter and Liza. At the small balm, there is a factory inauguration ceremony to turn a billion people into machine humans.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1979-01-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gp0Kteki76AN6gk3HJuhBwedFKV.jpg","stills":[{"ty